                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "urinal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41ad1f9e-1a10-3f52-942e-d5fab6b1e185",
                                        "entry_id": "e52dde7c-7284-3474-8b72-8afdb14266e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of urinary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f58a15a-7f2b-4902-b8c7-066209a08961",
                                                "sense_id": "41ad1f9e-1a10-3f52-942e-d5fab6b1e185",
                                                "text": "If on the other hand it is to be used by a congregation, which as a rule, only occupy their church once, twice or three times a week, then I would suggest where it can be obtained that an improved “water closet” be used, and by this I mean a urinal and fecal basin, which can be kept clean by liberal flushing with water after each time it is used, and so trapped and ventilated as to absolutely protect the room in which it is placed from any contamination whatever.[…]This same closet can be arranged for urinal purposes by having the lid of the seat for each person attached to a hinge so that it can be raised up when desired to be used for micturation^([sic]) only."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e61a1e3-23d7-41a4-88ae-2c1773ef66dc",
                                                "sense_id": "41ad1f9e-1a10-3f52-942e-d5fab6b1e185",
                                                "text": "Q. What amount, in cubic feet, would there be in Port Huron for one year, of fecal and urinal discharge into the sewers?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d85175a7-3aa9-46dd-82fb-2cbf9a4991fd",
                                                "sense_id": "41ad1f9e-1a10-3f52-942e-d5fab6b1e185",
                                                "text": "Urinal and fecal wastes were placed in runoff boxes at the base, midpoint and top of 20cm snow packs. The units were subjected to carefully controlled temperature fluctuations ranging from 8 to 12 degrees C. Urinal losses were determined primarily by the quantity of water which passed through the manure layer. Fecal nitrogen losses were much lower than urinal losses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1dc3835c-39da-4a3a-8400-7e85237eb77e",
                        "source_entry_id": "93e3f5c9-a4d4-35fb-8511-f498eb34fbb2",
                        "target_lang_word": "urinoir",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "urinoir",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca0471da-5ddb-380d-b4ff-2a233e312e0d",
                                        "entry_id": "2bec34fb-630f-3322-928e-b02911103520",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Local disposé sur la voie publique, dans les gares, etc., pour uriner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae3e3fe2-4079-40d5-99b5-b2d930f1f40b",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0471da-5ddb-380d-b4ff-2a233e312e0d",
                                                "text": "Je me souviens qu’un jour à Paris, un Américain m’avait bien étonné en me parlant des « Picon ». Il croyait que c’était là le nom des urinoirs parce qu’à l’époque de grosses affiches publicitaires Picon ornaient ces édicules."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bc287bd-581f-45f9-9332-5e7689c0c5e7",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0471da-5ddb-380d-b4ff-2a233e312e0d",
                                                "text": "De la même façon, le Tribunal des conflits eut à régler une affaire dans laquelle un maire avait fait enlever la grille en fer forgé entourant une église, afin d’installer un urinoir public contre l’édifice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d62916f1-7ee3-40cd-96ef-9431ffcccb07",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0471da-5ddb-380d-b4ff-2a233e312e0d",
                                                "text": "On supprime les urinoirs publics et le nombre des cafés et des buvettes augmente ? Il faudrait un peu d'équilibre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "936da5b3-f8c2-3999-95a8-13ff6c42b6fc",
                                        "entry_id": "2bec34fb-630f-3322-928e-b02911103520",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Appareil sanitaire dans lequel les hommes et garçons urinent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4543d4da-1bbf-4a47-b8d1-c50b8351614d",
                                                "sense_id": "936da5b3-f8c2-3999-95a8-13ff6c42b6fc",
                                                "text": "Mieux vaut l’aveugle qui pisse par la fenêtre que le farceur qui lui a fait croire que c’était l’urinoir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8c1958a-a955-4e43-9497-f5f25db09538",
                                                "sense_id": "936da5b3-f8c2-3999-95a8-13ff6c42b6fc",
                                                "text": "Un gamin noir qui pissait un bock dans l’urinoir a dit que Jimmie est entré dans un des cabinets et a fermé la porte. Une minute plus tard, un mec est arrivé, a ouvert la porte d'un coup de pied et a tiré à deux reprises, à bout portant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
